{
  "_about": "Shared by deriveHealthConnectHrv (src/lib/sleep-sessions.js) and its Kotlin port SleepDerivation.deriveHrv, the foreground sync and the background worker (#279). A day's HRV is the average of the Health Connect HeartRateVariabilityRmssd readings taken during the night you woke up from that day; with none there, the day's readings outside any other day's night. Expected values are worked by hand. Samples are [time, RMSSD in ms]; sessions are as in sleep-sessions.json.",
